ElektraWatt third-party notices
================================

This file lists third-party material committed to this repository. The notices of third-party Rust crates are
generated per release with cargo-about (about.toml, ci/third-party-notices.hbs).

Bundled fonts (assets/fonts/, ADR-0028)
---------------------------------------

Noto Sans, Noto Sans Condensed, Noto Sans Mono, Noto Sans Math and Routed Gothic are licensed under the SIL Open Font
License, Version 1.1 (OFL-1.1); the licence text is LICENSES/OFL-1.1.txt. The files are unmodified copies of static unhinted
TrueType files and are pinned by SHA-256 in crates/ew-text (ADR-0028 recommendation 6); Noto Sans SemiBold, a face of
the user interface only (WP-S2.17), is pinned in crates/ew-ui. The Noto Sans and Noto Sans Condensed files are the
instances of the upstream repository at the commit named in each Source URL (the repository publishes no release
tags). Noto Sans Mono and Noto Sans Math are not raw commit files: each is the file at the path named under "Source"
inside a notofonts release asset. Noto Sans Math is the symbol fallback face (ADR-0028 recommendation 3); Noto Sans
Condensed and Noto Sans Mono are the narrow and the monospaced face a text style may choose (ADR-0028 amendment 2).
Noto is a trademark of Google Inc. (font name table entry 7); the trademark line is reproduced here as the
OFL-1.1 requires for redistributed copies (decision ID-51). Routed Gothic is the technical-drawing face a text style
may choose (ADR-0028 amendment 3): the file of the upstream repository's release tag v1.0.0, unmodified, under the
name of its role here; "Routed Gothic" is its Reserved Font Name.

